{"ticker":"PGIL","symbol":"PGIL","instrumentId":3095384,"name":"Pearl Global Ind.","industry":"NSE-Apparel-Clothing Mfg","about":"Pearl Global Industries Ltd. is a prominent apparel manufacturer and exporter, catering to some of the world’s leading fashion brands and retailers. The company specializes in producing ready-to-wear garments, including casual wear, formal wear, and outerwear, for men, women, and children. With state-of-the-art manufacturing facilities in India, Bangladesh, Vietnam, and Indonesia, Pearl Global ensures high-quality, trend-driven designs and efficient production. The company’s strong focus on sustainability, ethical practices, and compliance with international standards makes it a trusted partner in the global apparel supply chain. Pearl Global’s commitment to innovation, quality, and timely delivery drives its success in the competitive fashion industry.","website":"www.pearlglobal.com","location":"New Delhi, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:48:17.824Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":1404.1,"changePct":-0.7492754647628569,"week52High":1427.5,"week52Low":677},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹12,987 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹5,814 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"36,996,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"130"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"24,800,070"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.96%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"8.88"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.8"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"7.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.23"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.22"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"14%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"35.7"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"6–34"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"19.0%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"43.16"},{"label":"Volume","value":"340,815"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"212,031"},{"label":"Master score","value":"80"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"93"},{"label":"Price strength","v